`details` carries a key named `api_token`. The reference writer splits a key on non-alphanumerics and camelCase boundaries and drops it when any segment is one of eleven words (authorization, content, file, password, path, payload, prompt, request, secret, token). The schema now refuses the same keys by `propertyNames`, so a writer that skipped the sanitiser cannot produce a valid record either. Renaming the field to dodge the list defeats the control; `estimated_files_touched` is legal because `files` is not `file`.
